{
  "high_level_description": "A single seamless panoramic 3×3 contact sheet showing the same classic European living room from nine synchronized viewpoints. The grid represents a complete spatial survey where each cell is a different camera position around the room while all furniture, architecture, lighting, perspective, object placement, and orientation remain perfectly consistent across every panel.",
  "style_description": {
    "aesthetics": "classic European interior, French and English traditional style, warm nostalgic atmosphere, cohesive panoramic composition, subtle cinematic film texture, architectural visualization quality, perfectly matched exposure across all nine panels",
    "lighting": "soft natural daylight entering from the east floor-to-ceiling window, gentle warm ambient bounce light, consistent illumination and shadows in every panel",
    "photo": "architectural interior photography, ultra sharp, 24mm wide-angle lens, eye-level views except true orthographic top-down center panel, high dynamic range, realistic materials",
    "medium": "photograph",
    "color_palette": [
      "#F2EEE7",
      "#DDD3C2",
      "#8A5A3B",
      "#5B3A29",
      "#C8A36A",
      "#A52A2A",
      "#F5F2E8",
      "#B08D57",
      "#6E4B2A",
      "#355E3B",
      "#ECE4D8",
      "#8E8E82"
    ]
  },
  "compositional_deconstruction": {
    "background": "A perfectly aligned seamless 3×3 panoramic contact sheet separated only by thin subtle light-gray grid lines. Every panel belongs to the same European living room with identical brightness, contrast, color grading, lens characteristics and perspective continuity. Global layout never changes: center deep brown leather three-seat sofa faces south; rectangular oak coffee table with white ceramic vase and hardcover books; north wall contains a white fireplace facing south with a gold-framed landscape painting above and symmetrical built-in bookshelves filled with books and candlesticks; east wall has a large floor-to-ceiling window with beige linen curtains overlooking a lush green garden; west wall has a grandfather clock and a tall fiddle-leaf fig; south wall has a decorative sideboard facing north beneath a round mirror with a brass table lamp and ornaments; pale plaster ceiling with crown molding and crystal chandelier; dark herringbone wood floor with beige-gray wool rug beneath sofa and table.",
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [0, 0, 333, 333],
        "desc": "Northwest viewpoint. Standing eye level with a slight downward viewing angle looking southeast. Visible are the left built-in bookshelf on the north wall, the upper portion and west side of the white fireplace, the full front of the grandfather clock, the upper canopy of the fiddle-leaf fig on the west wall, the west armrest of the central dark brown leather sofa, the west half of the oak coffee table with the white ceramic vase and hardcover books, diagonal herringbone floor texture, all objects aligned with the fixed room layout."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [0, 333, 333, 667],
        "desc": "North viewpoint. Eye-level view directly facing the north wall. The fireplace front is centered with the gold-framed landscape painting above and symmetrical bookshelves on both sides. The back of the south-facing leather sofa occupies the foreground center. Only the north edge of the coffee table is visible. The floor-to-ceiling window appears at the far right edge, while the grandfather clock appears at the far left edge. Furniture orientation remains identical to every other panel."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [0, 667, 333, 1000],
        "desc": "Northeast viewpoint. Standing eye level with a slight downward angle looking southwest. Visible are the right built-in bookshelf, the upper portion and east side of the fireplace, the floor-to-ceiling window with beige linen curtains and green garden outside, the east armrest of the leather sofa, the east half of the oak coffee table including the vase and books, diagonal herringbone floor pattern, perfectly matching neighboring viewpoints."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [333, 0, 667, 333],
        "desc": "West viewpoint. Eye-level view directly facing the west wall. The grandfather clock is fully visible from the front beside the entire fiddle-leaf fig. The west side of the leather sofa and west side of the coffee table occupy the middle ground. The west side of the fireplace and west side of the decorative sideboard are visible. The east floor-to-ceiling window appears in the distant right background. All architectural positions remain fixed."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [333, 333, 667, 667],
        "desc": "True orthographic top-down view. The entire room is viewed vertically from above with no perspective distortion. Visible are the sofa footprint facing south, the rectangular coffee table with the top-down shapes of the white ceramic vase and hardcover books, the beige-gray rug, the top of the grandfather clock, the canopy of the fiddle-leaf fig, the fireplace top, decorative sideboard top, crystal chandelier centered on the ceiling, bookshelf footprints, window sill and curtain positions, continuous dark herringbone wood flooring, and perfectly coherent spatial relationships among every object."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [333, 667, 667, 1000],
        "desc": "East viewpoint. Eye-level view directly facing the east wall. The floor-to-ceiling window fills the view with beige curtains and lush green garden outside. The east side of the leather sofa and east side of the coffee table occupy the center. The east side of the fireplace and east side of the decorative sideboard are visible. The grandfather clock appears in the distant left background. Object positions exactly match the global layout."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [667, 0, 1000, 333],
        "desc": "Southwest viewpoint. Standing eye level with a slight downward viewing angle looking northeast. The decorative sideboard front beneath the round mirror is prominent together with the brass table lamp and ornaments. Visible are the southwest front corner of the leather sofa, the southwest front corner of the coffee table with the vase and books, diagonal herringbone flooring, while the fireplace and floor-to-ceiling window appear in the distant upper-right background. Continuity with adjacent viewpoints is seamless."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [667, 333, 1000, 667],
        "desc": "South viewpoint. Eye-level view directly facing the south wall. The decorative sideboard is centered beneath the round mirror with the brass table lamp and decorative objects. The front cushions and armrests of the leather sofa dominate the foreground, with the south edge of the coffee table nearest the viewer. The fireplace is centered in the distant background on the north wall, the floor-to-ceiling window appears on the background right, and the grandfather clock appears on the background left. Furniture orientation is completely consistent."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [667, 667, 1000, 1000],
        "desc": "Southeast viewpoint. Standing eye level with a slight downward viewing angle looking northwest. The right portion of the decorative sideboard and brass table lamp are visible. The southeast front corner of the leather sofa and southeast front corner of the coffee table are nearest the viewer. The floor-to-ceiling window and beige curtains occupy the immediate right side. The fireplace appears in the distant upper-left background. Diagonal herringbone floor texture remains perfectly continuous and all object orientations exactly match every neighboring panel."
      }
    ]
  }
}

{
  "high_level_description": "A cute promotional e-commerce poster for a Double 11 pre-sale campaign, featuring fluffy pink Chinese typography, a smiling fuzzy handbag character, a blue fuzzy megaphone, gift boxes, and discount mini bags. The poster has a playful toy-like 3D commercial style with soft fur textures, bright pink and orange accents, and clear shopping discount information.",
